{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16616","headline":"萧山祗园寺 · 丘丹","name":"萧山祗园寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东晋许徴君，西方彦上人。\n生时犹定见，悟後了前因。\n灵塔多年古，高僧苦行频。\n碑存才记日，藤老岂知春。\n车骑归萧詧，云林识许询。\n千秋不相见，悟定是吾身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘丹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}